{"2189450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Boba Tea Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 2189450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/6b17cd1bf5beec251f31961ca6bb8dfa.avif?t=1764685940\" width=614 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/012891e988bc210e4f391dbdfda85004.avif?t=1764685940\" width=615 height=105 /></span>In Boba Tea Shop Simulator, you get to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Make various type of drinks, add different toppings and try your best to satisfy customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Manage the time well and add the right amount of toppings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●The quality of your drinks will affect your score and popularity of your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Making drinks can also be satisfying with the in-game audio and hilarious physics you can play around with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/b6c2e6ae5217b9a617b11c5b6b305893.poster.avif?t=1764685940\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/b6c2e6ae5217b9a617b11c5b6b305893.webm?t=1764685940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/b6c2e6ae5217b9a617b11c5b6b305893.mp4?t=1764685940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/7cb1d5ce2a395783bbd379fb561c31eb.avif?t=1764685940\" width=615 height=105 /></span>Being a shop owner isn't easy, you have to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Restock different types of supplies and consumables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Boil tea and clean up the mess you made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Finding your own pace on doing the errands is the key to a successful tea shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ea95cc642f5a044eaf6b2d638745ad7c.poster.avif?t=1764685940\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ea95cc642f5a044eaf6b2d638745ad7c.webm?t=1764685940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ea95cc642f5a044eaf6b2d638745ad7c.mp4?t=1764685940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/d6d27f71d11b0034b788017f0fad7508.avif?t=1764685940\" width=615 height=105 /></span>     ●Spending on the decorations and furnitures for your tea shop can be a good idea, the customers prefer clean and stylized shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●You can place the items anywhere you want and create your one and only tea shop in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ee97f3d939c702f814bfefba910e3f3f.poster.avif?t=1764685940\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ee97f3d939c702f814bfefba910e3f3f.webm?t=1764685940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ee97f3d939c702f814bfefba910e3f3f.mp4?t=1764685940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/eeb4f3ffba092778d565db8b0085abd9.avif?t=1764685940\" width=615 height=105 /></span>     ●By completing different tasks, you can unlock more type of tea and missions, doing tasks can also increase your shop's popularity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Making smart choices during tasks can also affect how well your shop is going to do in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/3dc0d05463f25d8d25aaa1bd70e78df6.poster.avif?t=1764685940\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/3dc0d05463f25d8d25aaa1bd70e78df6.webm?t=1764685940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/3dc0d05463f25d8d25aaa1bd70e78df6.mp4?t=1764685940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/6b17cd1bf5beec251f31961ca6bb8dfa.avif?t=1764685940\" width=614 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/012891e988bc210e4f391dbdfda85004.avif?t=1764685940\" width=615 height=105 /></span>In Boba Tea Shop Simulator, you get to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Make various type of drinks, add different toppings and try your best to satisfy customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Manage the time well and add the right amount of toppings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●The quality of your drinks will affect your score and popularity of your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Making drinks can also be satisfying with the in-game audio and hilarious physics you can play around with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/b6c2e6ae5217b9a617b11c5b6b305893.poster.avif?t=1764685940\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/b6c2e6ae5217b9a617b11c5b6b305893.webm?t=1764685940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/b6c2e6ae5217b9a617b11c5b6b305893.mp4?t=1764685940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/7cb1d5ce2a395783bbd379fb561c31eb.avif?t=1764685940\" width=615 height=105 /></span>Being a shop owner isn't easy, you have to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Restock different types of supplies and consumables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Boil tea and clean up the mess you made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     ●Finding your own pace on doing the errands is the key to a successful tea shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189450/extras/ea95cc642f5a044eaf6b2d638745ad7c.poster.avif?t=1764685940\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.